{"id":"a31024701b006c36","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-turing-machine.md","title":"A self-contained deterministic Turing-machine model","display":"df-turing-machine — A self-contained deterministic Turing-machine model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-turing-machine","aliases":["27-df-turing-machine"],"display":"df-turing-machine — A self-contained deterministic Turing-machine model","depends_on":["[[27-df-bool]]","[[27-df-nat]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"Appendix B.2, one-tape Turing machines","source_printed_pages":"617–618","source_pdf_pages":"641–642","verification_status":"source-description-checked-explicit-set-theoretic-encoding","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-turing-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-machine — A self-contained deterministic Turing-machine model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1da79f596b2671f9\" href=\"?note=1da79f596b2671f9\" title=\"27-df-bool\">27-df-bool</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Appendix B.2, one-tape Turing machines"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"617–618"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"641–642"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-description-checked-explicit-set-theoretic-encoding"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B,\\mathbb B^*\">\\(\\mathbb B,\\mathbb B^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1da79f596b2671f9\" href=\"?note=1da79f596b2671f9\" title=\"27-df-bool\">27-df-bool</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 为标准整数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 为标准自然数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdot\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限元组编码。参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 有限且含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{1,2\\})\\times\\{0,1,2\\}\\to Q\\times\\{0,1,2\\}\\times\\{-1,1\\}\">\\(\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{1,2\\})\\times\\{0,1,2\\}\\to Q\\times\\{0,1,2\\}\\times\\{-1,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\delta)\">\\(M=(Q,\\delta)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbb B^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\omega\">\\(t\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,q&#39;\\in Q\">\\(q,q&#39;\\in Q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(h,h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。带内容以图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\tau\\prime:\\mathbb Z\\to\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(\\tau,\\tau\\prime:\\mathbb Z\\to\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span> 表示，非空白支持有限；2 是空白符；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(h\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\Gamma\">\\(s\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 引入带更新图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau[h\\mapsto s]\">\\(\\tau[h\\mapsto s]\\)</span>；其形式构造见下式。有限运行列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C_0,\\ldots,C_t)\">\\((C_0,\\ldots,C_t)\\)</span> 的下标集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,t\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,t\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>下式引入的定义符号包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}},\\mathrm{Step}_M,\\mathrm{Run}_M,\\mathrm{Halt}_M,\\mathrm{Accepts}_M,\\mathrm{Decides}_M\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}},\\mathrm{Step}_M,\\mathrm{Run}_M,\\mathrm{Halt}_M,\\mathrm{Accepts}_M,\\mathrm{Decides}_M\\)</span>；它们依次表示状态名、配置一步关系、有限运行关系、终止关系、接受谓词与判定语言谓词，不预设其定义之外的计算行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\{0,1,2\\},\\qquad H\\coloneqq\\{1,2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\{0,1,2\\},\\qquad H\\coloneqq\\{1,2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{(Q,\\delta)\\mid Q\\subseteq\\omega\\land |Q|&lt;\\infty\\land\\{0,1,2\\}\\subseteq Q\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus H)\\times\\Gamma\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,1\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{(Q,\\delta)\\mid Q\\subseteq\\omega\\land |Q|&lt;\\infty\\land\\{0,1,2\\}\\subseteq Q\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus H)\\times\\Gamma\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,1\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_M\\coloneqq\\mathbb B,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{start}}\\coloneqq0,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\\coloneqq1,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\coloneqq2\\quad(M=(Q,\\delta)\\in\\mathrm{TM}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_M\\coloneqq\\mathbb B,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{start}}\\coloneqq0,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\\coloneqq1,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\coloneqq2\\quad(M=(Q,\\delta)\\in\\mathrm{TM}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\coloneqq\\{\\tau\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\mid|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z\\mid\\tau(j)\\ne2\\}|&lt;\\infty\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times\\mathcal U\\times\\mathbb Z.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal U\\coloneqq\\{\\tau\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\mid|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z\\mid\\tau(j)\\ne2\\}|&lt;\\infty\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times\\mathcal U\\times\\mathbb Z.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau[h\\mapsto s]\\coloneqq\\{(j,b)\\in\\mathbb Z\\times\\Gamma:(j=h\\land b=s)\\lor(j\\ne h\\land b=\\tau(j))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau[h\\mapsto s]\\coloneqq\\{(j,b)\\in\\mathbb Z\\times\\Gamma:(j=h\\land b=s)\\lor(j\\ne h\\land b=\\tau(j))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\quad\\tau_w(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j&amp;1\\leq j\\leq|w|,\\\\2&amp;j&lt;1\\lor j&gt;|w|,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mathrm{Init}_M(w)\\coloneqq(0,\\tau_w,1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\quad\\tau_w(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j&amp;1\\leq j\\leq|w|,\\\\2&amp;j&lt;1\\lor j&gt;|w|,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mathrm{Init}_M(w)\\coloneqq(0,\\tau_w,1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Step}_M(C,C&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists q\\in Q\\setminus H\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\exists q&#39;\\in Q\\;\\exists s\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\n\\left(C=(q,\\tau,h)\\land\\delta(q,\\tau(h))=(q&#39;,s,d)\\land C&#39;=(q&#39;,\\tau[h\\mapsto s],h+d)\\right)\n\\quad(C,C&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Step}_M(C,C&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists q\\in Q\\setminus H\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\exists q&#39;\\in Q\\;\\exists s\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\n\\left(C=(q,\\tau,h)\\land\\delta(q,\\tau(h))=(q&#39;,s,d)\\land C&#39;=(q&#39;,\\tau[h\\mapsto s],h+d)\\right)\n\\quad(C,C&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Run}_M(w,t,C)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;t\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\mathbf C\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M^{\\{0,\\ldots,t\\}}\\;(\\mathbf C_0=\\mathrm{Init}_M(w)\\land\\mathbf C_t=C\\land\\forall j\\in\\{r\\in\\omega:r&lt;t\\}\\;\\mathrm{Step}_M(\\mathbf C_j,\\mathbf C_{j+1}))\\quad(C\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Run}_M(w,t,C)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;t\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\mathbf C\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M^{\\{0,\\ldots,t\\}}\\;(\\mathbf C_0=\\mathrm{Init}_M(w)\\land\\mathbf C_t=C\\land\\forall j\\in\\{r\\in\\omega:r&lt;t\\}\\;\\mathrm{Step}_M(\\mathbf C_j,\\mathbf C_{j+1}))\\quad(C\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,q,\\tau,h)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;q\\in H\\land\\mathrm{Run}_M(w,t,(q,\\tau,h)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,q,\\tau,h)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;q\\in H\\land\\mathrm{Run}_M(w,t,(q,\\tau,h)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists t\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,1,\\tau,h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists t\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,1,\\tau,h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decides}_M(L)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;\\left((\\exists t\\in\\omega\\;\\exists q\\in H\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,q,\\tau,h))\\land(w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Decides}_M(L)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;\\left((\\exists t\\in\\omega\\;\\exists q\\in H\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,q,\\tau,h))\\land(w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Erase}:\\mathcal U\\to\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Erase}(\\tau)\\coloneqq(\\tau(j(k)))_{k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}}\\quad\\left(\\begin{gathered}\n\\tau\\in\\mathcal U,\\quad r\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad j:\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{h\\in\\mathbb Z\\mid\\tau(h)\\ne2\\},\\\\\n\\forall k,\\ell\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;(k&lt;\\ell\\Rightarrow j(k)&lt;j(\\ell))\n\\end{gathered}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Erase}:\\mathcal U\\to\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Erase}(\\tau)\\coloneqq(\\tau(j(k)))_{k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}}\\quad\\left(\\begin{gathered}\n\\tau\\in\\mathcal U,\\quad r\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad j:\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{h\\in\\mathbb Z\\mid\\tau(h)\\ne2\\},\\\\\n\\forall k,\\ell\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;(k&lt;\\ell\\Rightarrow j(k)&lt;j(\\ell))\n\\end{gathered}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Output}_M\\coloneqq\\{(w,\\mathrm{Erase}(\\tau))\\mid w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\land\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\exists t\\in\\omega\\;\\exists q\\in H\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,q,\\tau,h)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Output}_M\\coloneqq\\{(w,\\mathrm{Erase}(\\tau))\\mid w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\land\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\exists t\\in\\omega\\;\\exists q\\in H\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,q,\\tau,h)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Appendix B.2 的双向单带确定型机器，固定二进制输入字母表；状态和空白符分别属于不同位置的载体。转移只在非终止态定义，故停机时刻与最终配置唯一，Output 为部分函数。有限支持在单步下保持，Erase 由整数顺序唯一决定。此处内建实际模型与接口，取代原书目录对 88 号外部机器原子的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-bool","status":"resolved","id":"1da79f596b2671f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-nat","status":"resolved","id":"d87d01e5686c19fe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-nat]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bool","status":"resolved","id":"1da79f596b2671f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb B,\\mathbb B^*$ 见 [[27-df-bool]]，$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[27-df-nat]]；$\\mathbb Z$ 为标准整数，$\\omega$ 为标准自然数。$\\langle\\cdot\\rangle$ 为有限元组编码。参数 $Q\\subseteq\\omega$ 有限且含 $\\{0,1,2\\}$，$\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{1,2\\})\\times\\{0,1,2\\}\\to Q\\times\\{0,1,2\\}\\times\\{-1,1\\}$，$M=(Q,\\delta)$，$w\\in\\mathbb B^*$，$t\\in\\omega$，$q,q'\\in Q$，$h,h'\\in\\mathbb Z$。带内容以图 $\\tau,\\tau\\prime:\\mathbb Z\\to\\{0,1,2\\}$ 表示，非空白支持有限；2 是空白符；对 $\\tau\\in\\mathcal U$、$h\\in\\mathbb Z$、$s\\in\\Gamma$ 引入带更新图 $\\tau[h\\mapsto s]$；其形式构造见下式。有限运行列 $(C_0,\\ldots,C_t)$ 的下标集为 $\\{0,\\ldots,t\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-nat","status":"resolved","id":"d87d01e5686c19fe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb B,\\mathbb B^*$ 见 [[27-df-bool]]，$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[27-df-nat]]；$\\mathbb Z$ 为标准整数，$\\omega$ 为标准自然数。$\\langle\\cdot\\rangle$ 为有限元组编码。参数 $Q\\subseteq\\omega$ 有限且含 $\\{0,1,2\\}$，$\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{1,2\\})\\times\\{0,1,2\\}\\to Q\\times\\{0,1,2\\}\\times\\{-1,1\\}$，$M=(Q,\\delta)$，$w\\in\\mathbb B^*$，$t\\in\\omega$，$q,q'\\in Q$，$h,h'\\in\\mathbb Z$。带内容以图 $\\tau,\\tau\\prime:\\mathbb Z\\to\\{0,1,2\\}$ 表示，非空白支持有限；2 是空白符；对 $\\tau\\in\\mathcal U$、$h\\in\\mathbb Z$、$s\\in\\Gamma$ 引入带更新图 $\\tau[h\\mapsto s]$；其形式构造见下式。有限运行列 $(C_0,\\ldots,C_t)$ 的下标集为 $\\{0,\\ldots,t\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B,\\mathbb B^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{1,2\\})\\times\\{0,1,2\\}\\to Q\\times\\{0,1,2\\}\\times\\{-1,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\mathbb B^*","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"q,q'\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"h,h'\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau,\\tau\\prime:\\mathbb Z\\to\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau[h\\mapsto s]","display":false},{"tex":"(C_0,\\ldots,C_t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,t\\}","display":false},{"tex":"q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}},\\mathrm{Step}_M,\\mathrm{Run}_M,\\mathrm{Halt}_M,\\mathrm{Accepts}_M,\\mathrm{Decides}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\{0,1,2\\},\\qquad H\\coloneqq\\{1,2\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{(Q,\\delta)\\mid Q\\subseteq\\omega\\land |Q|<\\infty\\land\\{0,1,2\\}\\subseteq Q\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus H)\\times\\Gamma\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,1\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_M\\coloneqq\\mathbb B,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{start}}\\coloneqq0,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\\coloneqq1,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\coloneqq2\\quad(M=(Q,\\delta)\\in\\mathrm{TM}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\coloneqq\\{\\tau\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\mid|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z\\mid\\tau(j)\\ne2\\}|<\\infty\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times\\mathcal U\\times\\mathbb Z.","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau[h\\mapsto s]\\coloneqq\\{(j,b)\\in\\mathbb Z\\times\\Gamma:(j=h\\land b=s)\\lor(j\\ne h\\land b=\\tau(j))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\quad\\tau_w(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j&1\\leq j\\leq|w|,\\\\2&j<1\\lor j>|w|,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mathrm{Init}_M(w)\\coloneqq(0,\\tau_w,1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Step}_M(C,C')\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists q\\in Q\\setminus H\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\exists q'\\in Q\\;\\exists s\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\n\\left(C=(q,\\tau,h)\\land\\delta(q,\\tau(h))=(q',s,d)\\land C'=(q',\\tau[h\\mapsto s],h+d)\\right)\n\\quad(C,C'\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Run}_M(w,t,C)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;t\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\mathbf C\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M^{\\{0,\\ldots,t\\}}\\;(\\mathbf C_0=\\mathrm{Init}_M(w)\\land\\mathbf C_t=C\\land\\forall j\\in\\{r\\in\\omega:r<t\\}\\;\\mathrm{Step}_M(\\mathbf C_j,\\mathbf C_{j+1}))\\quad(C\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,q,\\tau,h)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;q\\in H\\land\\mathrm{Run}_M(w,t,(q,\\tau,h)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists t\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,1,\\tau,h).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decides}_M(L)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;\\left((\\exists t\\in\\omega\\;\\exists q\\in H\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,q,\\tau,h))\\land(w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Erase}:\\mathcal U\\to\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Erase}(\\tau)\\coloneqq(\\tau(j(k)))_{k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}}\\quad\\left(\\begin{gathered}\n\\tau\\in\\mathcal U,\\quad r\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad j:\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{h\\in\\mathbb Z\\mid\\tau(h)\\ne2\\},\\\\\n\\forall k,\\ell\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;(k<\\ell\\Rightarrow j(k)<j(\\ell))\n\\end{gathered}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Output}_M\\coloneqq\\{(w,\\mathrm{Erase}(\\tau))\\mid w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\land\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\exists t\\in\\omega\\;\\exists q\\in H\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,q,\\tau,h)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":4834,"backlinks":[{"id":"f8a4092aca6c1520","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathrm{Accepts}_M$ 见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]；时间见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]。$\\mathrm{pair}$ 是 [[27-df-encoding]] 中显式构造的二进制配对编码。"},{"id":"65c23d4db160ede7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathrm{Decides}_M$ 见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]；$\\mathrm{Time}_M$ 见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]。"},{"id":"865d91735afbcff2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa,S_D,m_D$ 见 [[27-df-enumerationproblem]]。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathcal U$、$\\mathrm{Run}_M$ 见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]，$\\mathrm{Time}_M$ 见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]。下式将枚举器编码为 $A=\\langle M,o\\rangle$：$M$ 为现有确定型机器，$o$ 为该机器指定的非初始、非停机输出状态。输出事件、合法枚举器集合、输出时刻与复杂度谓词均由下式构造；$\\mathbb N[X]$ 沿用上述非负系数多项式集合。"},{"id":"b12857db11f1d566","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$L_1,L_2\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*$；机器、输出函数见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]，运行时间见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]。"},{"id":"fe90a43e6765ed55","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$w\\in\\mathbb B^*$；机器与 $\\mathrm{Halt}_M$ 见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]。用序数 $\\omega$ 作为扩充自然数的无穷元，通常序数序延伸有限整数序。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-359","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-turing-machine|df-turing-machine — A self-contained deterministic Turing-machine model]]"}],"outgoing":["1da79f596b2671f9","d87d01e5686c19fe"]}